---
// The two rebalance triggers for one token: its weight wanders until it is 5 points off
// target, a rebalance brings it back, and the 30-day clock starts over.
// The track runs from 10% to 30% weight; ORCA targets 20% in DEXS.
---

<figure class="viz not-content dt">
	<div class="viz-loop" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="dt-head">
			<span class="viz-chip"><i style="--c:#d29a6e" />ORCA's weight</span>
			<span class="dt-status">
				<span class="dt-st dt-st1">Within 5 points: no trade</span>
				<span class="dt-st dt-st2">5 points off: rebalance</span>
				<span class="dt-st dt-st3">Back near target</span>
			</span>
		</div>
		<div class="dt-track">
			<span class="dt-band"></span>
			<span class="dt-edge dt-lo"></span>
			<span class="dt-edge dt-hi"></span>
			<span class="dt-target"></span>
			<span class="dt-dot"></span>
		</div>
		<div class="dt-scale">
			<span style="left:25%">15%</span>
			<span style="left:50%"><b>Target 20%</b></span>
			<span style="left:75%">25%</span>
		</div>

		<div class="dt-clock">
			<div class="dt-clock-head">
				<span>Time since last rebalance</span>
				<span>30 days</span>
			</div>
			<div class="dt-clock-bar"><b></b></div>
		</div>

		<div class="dt-gate">
			<span>Mints and redeems</span>
			<span class="dt-gate-state">
				<span class="dt-open">Open</span>
				<span class="dt-held">Waiting for the rebalance</span>
			</span>
		</div>
	</div>
	<figcaption class="viz-caption">
		A rebalance is due when any token is <b>5 percentage points</b> off its target, or <b>30 days</b> after the last one, whichever comes first. Afterwards every token is back near target, and the 30-day clock starts over.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.dt {
		--t: 12s;
	}
	.dt-head {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
	}
	.dt-status {
		display: grid;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.dt-st {
		grid-area: 1 / 1;
		justify-self: end;
		padding: 0.12rem 0.55rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.dt-st1,
	.dt-st3 {
		background: var(--viz-green-soft);
		color: var(--viz-green);
	}
	.dt-st2 {
		background: var(--viz-alert-soft);
		color: var(--viz-alert);
	}
	.dt-st1,
	.dt-st3 {
		opacity: 0;
	}

	/* The weight track: 10% at the left edge, 30% at the right. */
	.dt-track {
		position: relative;
		height: 2.2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		background: var(--viz-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--viz-line);
	}
	.dt-band {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0 25%;
		background: var(--viz-green-soft);
	}
	.dt-edge {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		width: 0;
		border-left: 2px dashed var(--viz-green-mid);
	}
	.dt-lo {
		left: 25%;
	}
	.dt-hi {
		left: 75%;
		border-left-color: var(--viz-alert);
	}
	.dt-target {
		position: absolute;
		left: 50%;
		top: -0.3rem;
		bottom: -0.3rem;
		width: 2px;
		margin-left: -1px;
		background: var(--viz-ink);
	}
	.dt-dot {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		left: 80%;
		width: 1rem;
		height: 1rem;
		margin: -0.5rem 0 0 -0.5rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #d29a6e;
		border: 2px solid var(--viz-alert);
		box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(40, 30, 20, 0.25);
	}
	.dt-scale {
		position: relative;
		height: 1.2rem;
		margin-top: 0.3rem;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		color: var(--viz-muted);
	}
	.dt-scale span {
		position: absolute;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.dt-scale b {
		color: var(--viz-ink);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.dt-clock {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}
	.dt-clock-head,
	.dt-gate {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--viz-muted);
	}
	.dt-clock-bar {
		height: 0.45rem;
		margin-top: 0.3rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--viz-line-soft);
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.dt-clock-bar b {
		display: block;
		height: 100%;
		background: var(--viz-ink-2);
		transform-origin: left;
		transform: scaleX(0.45);
		border-radius: 999px;
	}
	.dt-gate {
		margin-top: 0.85rem;
		padding-top: 0.7rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--viz-line-soft);
	}
	.dt-gate-state {
		display: grid;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.dt-gate-state > span {
		grid-area: 1 / 1;
		justify-self: end;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.dt-open {
		color: var(--viz-green);
	}
	.dt-held {
		color: var(--viz-copper);
		opacity: 0;
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
		.dt-dot {
			animation: dt-dot var(--t) infinite both;
		}
		.dt-hi {
			animation: dt-edge var(--t) infinite both;
		}
		.dt-st1 { animation: dt-st1 var(--t) infinite both; }
		.dt-st2 { animation: dt-st2 var(--t) infinite both; }
		.dt-st3 { animation: dt-st3 var(--t) infinite both; }
		.dt-clock-bar b {
			animation: dt-clock var(--t) infinite both;
		}
		.dt-open { animation: dt-open var(--t) infinite both; }
		.dt-held { animation: dt-held var(--t) infinite both; }
	}

	/* Weight w sits at left (w - 10) × 5%. It wanders 20 → 22.5 → 19 → 24 → 26, crossing
	   25 at about 40%, waits for the rebalance, then lands at 20.4. */
	@keyframes dt-dot {
		0% { left: 50%; border-color: var(--viz-card); }
		10% { left: 62%; }
		20% { left: 45%; }
		31% { left: 70%; border-color: var(--viz-card); }
		40% { left: 76%; border-color: var(--viz-alert); }
		44%, 50% { left: 80%; border-color: var(--viz-alert); }
		62% { left: 52%; border-color: var(--viz-card); }
		100% { left: 52%; border-color: var(--viz-card); }
	}
	@keyframes dt-edge {
		0%, 38% { border-left-color: var(--viz-green-mid); }
		41%, 58% { border-left-color: var(--viz-alert); }
		62%, 100% { border-left-color: var(--viz-green-mid); }
	}
	@keyframes dt-st1 {
		0%, 38% { opacity: 1; }
		40%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
	}
	@keyframes dt-st2 {
		0%, 38% { opacity: 0; }
		40%, 60% { opacity: 1; }
		62%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
	}
	@keyframes dt-st3 {
		0%, 60% { opacity: 0; }
		62%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
	}
	/* The clock runs, resets when the rebalance finishes, and runs again. */
	@keyframes dt-clock {
		0% { transform: scaleX(0.3); }
		50% { transform: scaleX(0.62); }
		60% { transform: scaleX(0.66); }
		63% { transform: scaleX(0); }
		100% { transform: scaleX(0.24); }
	}
	@keyframes dt-open {
		0%, 44% { opacity: 1; }
		46%, 61% { opacity: 0; }
		63%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
	}
	@keyframes dt-held {
		0%, 44% { opacity: 0; }
		46%, 61% { opacity: 1; }
		63%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
	}
</style>
